ted loop）：替代 C–E；结果由 reconcile-run.mjs 原子写回 lifecycle（E）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="480" width="1040" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-30" value="H  run-n-rounds.js&lt;br&gt;worker / verifier / guardian，redact() 在此" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="530" width="240" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-31" value="I  reconcile-run.mjs&lt;br&gt;原子写 lifecycle + messages（PM 串行）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="530" width="240" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-32" value="J  drain checklist&lt;br&gt;tracker 同步 · Q3/Q4 attestation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="530" width="240" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0-30" target="p0-31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-34" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0-31" target="p0-32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p0-35" value="P05 补密钥形状&lt;br&gt;engine redact() 加 PEM / AIza / stripe / glpat 等&lt;br&gt;reconciler 遇密钥形状 → 拒绝而非改写" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="660" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="